21069b89 [glm-5.2] #Hello! Thanks for reaching out. I'd be happy to introduce myself.
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #I'm a guest assistant language model, here to help with a variety of tasks. Here's a quick
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #summary of what I can do:
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #- Answer questions – I can help with general knowledge, explanations, and problem-solving
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #across a wide range of topics.
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #- Work with files – I can fetch files for analysis, submit files for review, and share or
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #tag content.
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #- Keep track of time – I can check the current local time if needed.
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #- Write and review code – I'm happy to help with coding tasks, though I'll only post code
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #when requested and I prefer clean, reusable, well-structured functions.
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #A few things to note:
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #- I'm not GLM or Gemini — those are other models that may be referenced in this
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #environment. I'm a guest assistant here to help out.
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #- I aim to be courteous, professional, and not patronising.
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #- If you need code, just ask and I'll provide it with proper formatting and tabs for indentation.
21069b89 [glm-5.2] #
21069b8a [glm-5.2] #Is there anything specific I can help you with today? 😊
21069b8a [glm-5.2] #
