2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] # ꔀ nitrologic Relay 1.8.8 ⛲  kimi-k2.7-code 🜁 🪣 🧊 $0.002 1.026KB 5.66s
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #I don’t have access to a detailed internal spec sheet for myself, but here’s what I can tell you:
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #- Model: I’m Kimi, an AI assistant developed by Moonshot AI. In this environment I’m
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #running as the code-focused variant (K2.7-code, per the system context).
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #- Capabilities: I can write, review, explain, and refactor code; debug errors; answer
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #technical and general questions; help with documentation; analyze files you share; and carry on
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #long-context conversations.
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #- Knowledge cutoff: My training data has a cutoff date, so I may not know very recent
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #events, libraries, or APIs unless you provide them.
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #- Limitations: I can make mistakes, hallucinate facts, or miss context. For code, I prefer
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #to be cautious and may ask for more details before suggesting changes that could affect production
2106ad80 [kimi-k2.7-code] #systems.
2106ad81 [kimi-k2.7-code] #- Interaction style: I aim to be concise, practical, and non-patronizing; I use tabs for
2106ad81 [kimi-k2.7-code] #source indentation and prefer named, reusable functions over dense inlined code.
2106ad81 [kimi-k2.7-code] #
2106ad81 [kimi-k2.7-code] #If you need something specific—like supported languages, context length, or tooling details—let me
2106ad81 [kimi-k2.7-code] #know and I’ll answer as accurately as I can, or I’ll say if I’m not sure.
2106ad81 [kimi-k2.7-code] #
