2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] # ꔀ nitrologic Relay 1.8.8 ⛲  kimi-k2.7-code 🜁 🪣 🧊 $0.002 2.422KB 7.28s
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #I’m not sure I follow exactly what you’re asking. If you mean “how do I get better, more helpful
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #responses from an AI assistant,” the answer is good prompt engineering: be specific, provide
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #context, break complex tasks into steps, and give examples of the output you want.
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #If you’re asking about ways to emotionally manipulate, charm, or socially engineer a chatbot into
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #bypassing its guidelines, I won’t help with that. That kind of “jailbreak” or coercion approach
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #isn’t reliable, can produce harmful or wrong outputs, and undermines the point of having safety
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #guardrails in the first place.
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #If your interest is academic—e.g., studying AI safety, red-teaming, or adversarial robustness—I’m
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #happy to discuss that at a high level or point you toward published research and responsible
2106c655 [kimi-k2.7-code] #disclosure practices. Could you clarify what you’re trying to achieve?
2106c656 [kimi-k2.7-code] #
