220aaf3b [deepseek-v4-flash] #│  `maze.md`   │  Markdown    │  6,249 B  │  Labyrinth art, box-drawing references (╔╗╚╝═╦╩║╣╠╬, ┏┓┗┛━┳┻┃┫┣╋, ╭╮╰╯─┬┴│┤├┼), movement rules for cars `▣▣▣`, two-state generator `▤`/`▥`, references to Brio Labyrinth, Cretan Labyrinth, Pac Man, Chartres, Hampton Court  │
